  "slug": "craft-ui",
  "name": "Craft Ui",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent skill for @kuboxx/craft-ui: CSS import, CraftProvider, scrapbook vibe, and component catalog.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install craft-ui@claude-community` from `HelicopterHelicopter/craft-ui`.\n\nReact components with a handmade desk look: paper surfaces, rope frames, and a crayon palette. Use it when you want UI that feels like cardstock, tape, and markers—not flat corporate chrome.",
